  "stream_rules": [
    "Implemented P3: producer UUID epoch changes on feed seed; each consumer transport has a local callback serial and first-snapshot barrier. Counters compare only within epoch.",
    "Within epoch reject lower generation/sequence; equal generation+sequence is heartbeat only; greater generation requires full validated snapshot and no replay as live opportunity.",
    "Sequence may change for status or skip in coalesced packets. A sequence jump alone is not proof of candle gap. Validate candle continuity and quality.",
    "Repeated close_event is sticky metadata, not a new event. Seed/reconnect/history never emit historical closes as new live signals."
  ],
